# Only app/package.json is needed (bun workspace resolution) — the rest of the
# app (Tauri/React source, Rust build artifacts) is excluded. Docker can't
# re-include a file whose parent directory is fully ignored, so app/ itself
# stays included and its heavy subpaths are excluded individually.
